    "description": {
      "value": "The carved night hag's hand at the end of this sandalwood staff clutches a rough gem. The staff of the Dreamlands makes it easier to navigate and survive in the Dreamlands and recognize its denizens. When wielding the staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Survival checks while in the Dreamlands and to checks to Recall Knowledge about creatures with the dream trait.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- **3rd** dream message\n- **4th** dream message, nightmare, sleep\n- **5th** dreaming potential, illusory scene"
    },
